{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba /Users/smkzw/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | sed -n '598,608p' && echo '--- current packet file mtimes' && stat -f '%Sm %N' -t '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %N' packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-a-payload.json packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-alias-map-v1.json packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-audit-package.json packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-a-payload.derivation.json && echo '--- sentinel raw intervention types and derived output' && jq -r '.studies[] | select(.protocolSection.identificationModule.nctId==\\\"NCT02534909\\\" or .protocolSection.identificationModule.nctId==\\\"NCT01335165\\\") | [.protocolSection.identificationModule.nctId,([.protocolSection.armsInterventionsModule.interventions[]|(.type+\\\":\\\"+.name)]|join(\\\" | \\\"))] | @tsv' .artifacts/source-cas/ctgov-live-20260906/evidence/raw/sha256/1e/1e0a9bbe959e38c122c9894782ff56b4ae3dc566179d199108c0af64eb56ab98.bin .artifacts/source-cas/ctgov-live-20260906/evidence/raw/sha256/c3/c3bdbe61b97e175e0a312cb37be064d3a74c38ada1c02dfde33e4e61a46fbdf3.bin && jq -r '.combo_regimens[] | select(.nct_id==\\\"NCT02534909\\\" or .nct_id==\\\"NCT01335165\\\") | @json' packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-a-payload.derivation.json && echo '--- products with default-like China+foreign but no China/foreign trial' && jq -r '([.trials[]|{pid:.product_id,region:.region}] | group_by(.pid) | map({pid:.[0].pid,regions:([.[].region]|unique)})) as \"'$t | .products[] as $p | select(($p.regions|sort)==[\"中国\",\"境外\"] or ($p.regions|sort)==[\"境外\",\"中国\"]) | (($t|map(select(.pid==$p.id))|.[0].regions)|sort) as $tr | select(($tr|index(\"中国\")|not) and ($tr|index(\"境外\")|not)) | [$p.id,$p.name,($p.regions|join(\"+\")),($tr|join(\"+\"))] | @tsv'\"' packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-a-payload.json\"","aggregated_output":"   598\t- when the user says an optional Yaozh route must not block core research or retain credentials/Cookies/profile -> keep it nonblocking, minimally receipted, and distinguish a persisted receipt from a runnable capability. [Task 3]\n   599\t\n   600\t## Reusable knowledge\n   601\t\n   602\t- v1 framing: one public entry with testable sub-skills; existing `competitive-intelligence-workflow` skill is historical/audit input rather than current authority. The three portal positions are `全景台`, `证据室`, and `设计图谱`; the observed first-version exclusions were PDF/PPT export, spreadsheet export, radar charts, evidence-maturity views, and scheduled monitoring. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   603\t- Separate “few competitors but sufficient decision value” from an apparently under-collected landscape. For key missing data, use independent clean-context review, two recovery rounds plus final review; for competitor-universe completeness, require source convergence plus independent review. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   604\t- Publication handling allows login-dependent source access without credential collection and manual supplement files. Block when a known primary or required extension/long-term publication is unavailable; after explicit one-time confirmation, continuation can be graded rather than silently substituting evidence. Validation targets immune-mediated indications including PNH and IgAN, with large indications for collection completeness and smaller indications for detailed key-trial handling. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   605\t- Recovery must collect outputs from the current `format` node’s explicit `site_relative_path` and `manifest_relative_path`, then validate locked site/manifest plus project, contract, report identity, and snapshot chain. A legacy node lacking those bindings fails closed and preserves historical artifacts. The repaired paths passed `722` integration tests, 11 recovery tests, 42 bounded-review tests, Ruff, strict mypy, and the reported gate suites. [Task 2]\n   606\t- `SemanticGroupingProposal` and `semantic_row_digest` bind a proposal to the full observation digest; source changes invalidate it. Use pairwise compatible complete-link buckets to prevent transitive merging; unknown/uncovered observations remain descriptive and are not dropped. A complete clinical unit includes disease/severity, background therapy, population, endpoint/event definition, scale/direction, estimand, denominator, analysis set, statistical form, and actual time window. [Task 2]\n   607\t- P3 uses a complete observation pool to form stable `scientific_group_id`, then projects physical pages after checking row ID, domain, and fact summary. Build `within_trial_longitudinal` before rendering to retain same-trial multi-timepoint identity; reject same-`row_id` cross-domain/fact-summary conflicts and unsupported cross-domain positive proposals. [Task 2]\n   608\t- The current recovery boundary is `context/PAUSE_HANDOFF_20260908_093147.md` at HEAD `bb27ec9d750cf02fb64da5dfe665b2f4b262922d`. Reopen the English implementation directory, hash/current Git state, P3 counterexamples, then independent review, gate, integration, and browser regression in that order. [Task 2]\n--- current packet file mtimes\n2026-09-12 21:24:24 N packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-a-payload.json\n2026-09-12 21:16:53 N packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-alias-map-v1.json\n2026-09-12 21:24:25 N packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-audit-package.json\n2026-09-12 21:24:24 N packets/2026-09-11-pnh-vertical/pnh-a-payload.derivation.json\n--- sentinel raw intervention types and derived output\nNCT02534909\tBIOLOGICAL:LFG316 | DRUG:LNP023\nNCT01335165\tDRUG:ALXN1102 | DRUG:ALXN1103\n{\"nct_id\":\"NCT02534909\",\"canonical_drugs\":[\"iptacopan\"]}\n{\"nct_id\":\"NCT01335165\",\"canonical_drugs\":[\"alxn1102\",\"alxn1103\"]}\n--- products with default-like China+foreign but no China/foreign trial\nlanoracopan-hydrochloride\tlanoracopan hydrochloride\t境外+中国\t未登记地点\nnm8074\tnm8074\t境外+中国\t未登记地点\nbusulfan\tbusulfan\t境外+中国\t未登记地点\nsln12140\tsln12140\t境外+中国\t未登记地点\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"agent_message","text":"## 结论：rejected\n\n当前实际载荷为 **50 产品/126 试验/218 疗效/74 安全/67 申办关系**，与所述 61/132/221/75/75 不一致。中国路线 `access_blocked` 与历史快照限制已如实声明，但当前仍存在实体过滤、关系投影和区域默认值问题，不能 accepted。\n\n## 六项修复复查（逐项 1-2 句）\n\n1. **非产品干预过滤：部分生效。** 产品名中未见 placebo、imaging、NCT、CliniMACS 等字面残留，但仍纳入 cyclophosphamide、fludarabine、busulfan、alemtuzumab、basiliximab 等移植/预处理相关实体。\n\n2. **别名映射：核心映射生效，但不完整。** `iptacopan`/`LNP023` 与 `eculizumab`/`Soliris` 各自已合并为一条，别名表未见明显错误归并；但 HRS-5965、HSK39297、NTQ5082 的制剂/剂量变体仍拆分，`soliris/ultomiris` 仍以复合字符串存在。\n\n3. **状态聚合：主要抽查生效。** `eculizumab` 当前为“已批准上市”，未再被“已完成”覆盖；但“招募中”和“进行中（不招募）”在实现中同级，严格优先级仍未完全体现。\n\n4. **区域派生：部分生效。** 试验中已有 54 条中国、64 条境外记录，且 31 个产品出现中国区域；但 busulfan、lanoracopan hydrochloride、nm8074、sln12140 在无登记地点时仍保留默认“中国+境外”。\n\n5. **试验-产品多对多：限制已记档，但主载荷仍有实质错配。** sidecar 记录 130 个联合组合、其中 36 个为多产品，history 也记录 G11-1；但主表单值 `product_id` 仍按排序后的首项投影，例如 NCT06799546 被归至 eculizumab、NCT04558918 被归至 eculizumab，无法代表完整产品关系。\n\n6. **未披露样本量：本轮记档充分。** sidecar 明列 4 个 NCT，history 重复列出全部 4 个；126 条入表试验、4 条样本量未披露、59 条无独立药物干预，数量可闭合至 CT.gov 当前 189 条记录。\n\n## 新问题（若有）\n\n- 当前实际文件与交付声明的五项数量均不一致，说明所声称的 61/132/221/75/75 版本未落在本次复核的物理载荷中。\n- 过滤规则至少漏纳/误伤了真实治疗性干预：NCT02534909 的 `LFG316` 为 `BIOLOGICAL`，未进入产品表；NCT01335165 的 `ALXN1103` 仅留在联合 sidecar，未形成独立产品实体。\n- 制剂和复合名称仍产生重复实体：`hrs-5965`、`hrs-5965 tablets`、`hrs-5965 capsules`、组合制剂，以及 `hsk39297`/`hsk39297 tablets`、`ntq5082` 剂量变体。\n- 产品区域在无地点记录时仍使用“中国+境外”默认值，不能称为完全由 `contactsLocationsModule` 真实派生。\n- 别名表本身未发现明显错误归并；主要问题是映射覆盖不足、复合干预拆分不足，以及单值主载荷对联合/对照关系的错误投影。\n\n## 观察意见（原样进入 scientific_review.observations，中文，≤5 条）\n\n1. 当前实际载荷数量与声明版本不一致，不能作为同一修复版本接受。  \n2. 产品表仍混入移植预处理相关药物，同时遗漏至少一个治疗性生物制品干预。  \n3. 别名核心归并有效，但制剂、剂量和复合名称仍未完成统一。  \n4. 联合试验虽有 sidecar 记录，主载荷单一 `product_id` 仍造成产品—试验关系错配。  \n5. 中国区域与样本量排除记录已有改进，但区域默认值和当前快照边界仍不足以支持 accepted。\n\n"}}
